# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `just test-asan-compact-choice`.
#
# Development shells that preload a command-trace shim (LD_PRELOAD, e.g.
# the agent-harbor shim) report that shim's own constructor allocations as
# leaks of every process; they are not this program's. Nothing of isonim is
# suppressed here.
leak:libah_command_trace_shim.so
